# Testing Rules
- Co-locate tests adjacent to source files: `[name].test.ts` next to `[name].ts`.
- Naming: `describe('Feature')` → `it('should...')`.
- Coverage thresholds: Branches ≥ 80% | Functions ≥ 90% | Lines ≥ 85%.
- Mocks: Only mock external boundaries (Database, External APIs, File System, Date).
- Fixtures must be deterministic with no shared mutable state.